title: agent-capsule
abstract: >
  agent-capsule seals AI coding sessions from Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, and
  Cline into tamper-evident SHA3-256 plus Ed25519 hashchains that anyone can
  verify offline, in the browser, with nothing to trust but the math. One shared
  crypto engine plus one thin adapter per tool produces a signed, hash-linked
  record of every agent action.
